    "detailed_description": "Bus, train and toilet friendly puzzle game now available on your less portable devices, created to test your power of logic.<br><br>Complete each level by turning all the <strong>tiles to a single colour</strong>. All levels can be completed in <strong>4 moves</strong> or less if you are skilled enough.<br><br>Good luck!!!<br><br>Features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 70 challenges to start, with more coming soon.<br></li><li> Complete each level casually for a bronze or silver medal, or try and beat the game with all golds!<br></li><li> Minimalistic visual and audio style.<br></li><li> A Zen puzzling experience.<br></li><li> Appropriate for all ages.</li></ul>",
